@startuml
title UC-07 - Update or Remove Workload
autonumber
actor Developer
boundary DeploymentController as API
control DeploymentService as Service
control PlanningService as Planner
control BeforeStateValidator as BeforeValidator
control DeltaBuilder as Delta
control ResourceProvisioningService as Provisioner
boundary WorkloadDeployer as Deployer
database ActiveResourceRepository as ResourceRepo
database EnvironmentRepository as EnvRepo
database DeploymentRepository as DeploymentRepo
database DeploymentDeltaSnapshotRepository as DeltaSnapshotRepo
database DeploymentSetRepository as SetRepo

Developer -> API: UpdateWorkload / RemoveWorkload
API -> Service: command
Service -> EnvRepo: LoadPlanningSnapshot() [MS-01]
EnvRepo --> Service: Current set + before contribution + version
Service -> Planner: Plan(before, after) [MS-02..MS-04]
Planner -> BeforeValidator: Validate(current, workloadID, before) [MS-02, BR-01]
BeforeValidator --> Planner: valid module + shared contribution
Planner -> Delta: BuildHumanitecDelta(current, workloadID, before, after) [MS-03]
Delta --> Planner: modules.add/remove/update + shared patch + Candidate
note right of Delta
Reject conflicting shared ID (BR-05).
Drop an omitted shared entry only when
no other module references it (BR-06).
Module update patches are module-relative;
shared patches are shared-object-relative (BR-07).
end note
Planner --> Service: Delta + Candidate + classification
Service -> DeltaSnapshotRepo: Save(immutable snapshot) <<plan transaction>>
Service -> SetRepo: Save(candidateSet) <<plan transaction>>
Service -> DeploymentRepo: SavePlanAndMark(PROVISIONING) <<plan transaction>>
Service -> Provisioner: Provision(desired resource batches) [MS-05]
Provisioner --> Service: Outputs
alt Update [VAR-01]
  Service -> Deployer: Apply(updated manifests) [MS-06]
  Service -> Deployer: WaitReady(workload)
else Remove [VAR-02]
  Service -> Deployer: Delete(workloadRef) [MS-06]
end
Service -> ResourceRepo: MarkUnreferenced(classification.unreferenced) [MS-07]
note right: No destroy call
Service -> EnvRepo: CompareVersionAndSetCurrent(candidate) <<final transaction>> [MS-08]
Service -> DeploymentRepo: MarkSucceeded() <<final transaction>>
Service --> API: DeploymentResult
API --> Developer: SUCCEEDED
@enduml
